11. Files from this setup

ascot_tests.json       # EDIT THIS: simulation/test data
run_ascot_tests.py     # REUSABLE ENGINE: normally leave unchanged
runs/                  # generated test results

The key idea is:

Put experiment data in ascot_tests.json; keep the execution logic in
run_ascot_tests.py.

This makes the ASCOT5 application easier to reproduce, extend and benchmark
across multiple HPC test cases.
